{"meta":{"id":"enum","category":"it/syntax/typescript/type-combination","title":"열거형 (Enum) · TS","subtitle":"(TYPESCRIPT)","summary":"숫자 · 문자열 enum, 리터럴 유니온과의 차이 (런타임 객체 생성 여부)","tags":["typescript","f-enum"],"color":"indigo","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-indigo","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-indigo-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-indigo-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 border border-indigo-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></span>TYPESCRIPT</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">열거형 (Enum) · TS</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-indigo-50/70 border border-indigo-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> 숫자 · 문자열 enum, 리터럴 유니온과의 차이 (런타임 객체 생성 여부)</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">숫자 열거형</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">enum Status {\r\n  Ready,      // 0\r\n  Running,    // 1\r\n  Done,       // 2\r\n}\r\nlet s: Status = Status.Running;\r\nconsole.log(Status[1]); // &quot;Running&quot; — 숫자 enum 은 역방향 조회 가능</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">값을 적지 않으면 0 부터 1씩 증가</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">문자열 열거형</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">enum Color {\r\n  Red = &quot;RED&quot;,\r\n  Green = &quot;GREEN&quot;,\r\n}\r\nfetch(`/api/items?color=${Color.Red}`);</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">로그 · 통신에서 값이 그대로 보여 디버깅이 쉽다</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">enum vs 리터럴 유니온</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">방식</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">특징</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>enum</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">실행 코드(JS 객체)가 생성됨 — 런타임에도 존재</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>type C = &quot;RED&quot; | &quot;GREEN&quot;</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">타입만 존재, 컴파일 후 사라짐 — 번들 크기 0</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>const enum</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">사용 위치에 값이 인라인되고 객체는 생성되지 않음</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> 컴파일 › 실행 시점에도 영향을 주는 문법</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/typescript/type-combination/enum","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"typescript","title":"TYPESCRIPT","path":"it/syntax/typescript"},{"id":"type-combination","title":"타입 조합 · 제한","path":"it/syntax/typescript/type-combination"}],"hasImage":false}